<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [70].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>70&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BLOOD AGAR</FONT></B></P>
Prepare Blood agar base (BD-Difco) according to the       direction, sterilize and cool to about 45C. Aseptically       add final 5% sterile defibrinated rabbit blood. Mix and quickly       dispense into sterile test tubes.       <br>
